  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Science Platform for Water Sciences</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With its mandate for the sciences, UNESCO at the global level is driving the shift to open science that has the transformative potential for reducing the existing inequalities in science, technology and innovation (STI) and accelerating progress towards the implementation of the 2030 Agenda and the achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). This work plan focusses on the development and integration of water sciences components, as part of the overall Open Science Platform. In particularly, it will focus on Open Data (IHP-WINS), Open Learning, Ecohydrology and Water Quality aspects of Open Science.</narrative>
  </description>
